                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0 position-relative" style="min-height: 480px;">
                    <iframe id="main-map-iframe" 
                        src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Gangapur+Gaon,+Nashik,+Maharashtra&t=&z=15&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" 
                        width="100%" 
                        height="480" 
                        style="border:0;" 
                        allowfullscreen="" 
                        loading="lazy" 
                        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
                    </iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer bg-light p-3">
                    <small class="text-muted">
                        <i class="fa fa-info-circle text-primary mr-1"></i>
                        <span id="map-footer-desc">गंगापूर गाव, गंगापूर रोड परिसरातील सर्व विद्यार्थी, कॉलेजियन्स आणि नोकरदारांसाठी मेस व टिफिन सेवा उपलब्ध.</span>
                    </small>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Branch Info & Quick Contact Card -->
        <div class="col-lg-5 mb-4">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow border-0 rounded-lg p-4 bg-white">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background: #fff3cd; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 15px;">
                        <i class="fa fa-cutlery text-warning" style="font-size: 24px;"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 id="info-branch-name" class="font-weight-bold mb-0 text-dark">MessHub - गंगापूर गाव (नाशिक)</h4>
